# vidreszr: Implement CResizerDMO.
# https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine/-/merge_requests/11516 state=closed
# Used by https://store.steampowered.com/app/330390/GRANDIA_II_HD_Remaster/.

I strongly suspect the game also needs !10791; I don't know if it needs anything else. Wine's changed the relevant pieces too much since 11.0 for me to dare backport anything into Proton 11; I'll just wait for Proton 12, I'm not in a hurry.

No AI was used during investigation of this bug or preparation of this patch. I like programming, why would I give the fun parts away?
